WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.783
(upbeat music)

00:00:00.783 --> 00:00:14.087
After you pick up your packages for delivery, click View Packages from the Home page in order to

00:00:14.087 --> 00:00:18.000
proceed with the actual delivery.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.087
You can select all packages listed or check off one box at a time to mark picked up, then click

00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:25.000
the Confirm button.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.462
Confirming a pickup is important for two reasons.

00:00:27.462 --> 00:00:33.000
It confirms that you have the packages in your possession in order to proceed to the next step.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.000
And it informs your contact at work that you are delivering the products you picked up.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Now that you have confirmed packages are picked up, you are ready to deliver them and complete the

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.000
service they requested.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.909
Communication with your customer is important.

00:00:46.909 --> 00:00:52.000
Let's look at the next steps that inform customers that their product is on their way.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.000
From the Job Detail page, send ETA to your customer by clicking Send ETA.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.200
Pick the time and click the text Customer.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:03.000
The customer immediately receives an ETA notification.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Now you can drive to the customer's location to deliver their product.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.320
When you arrive at the customer's location, click tap to see options.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:18.000
This action doesn't send the customer a message, it records your arrival time.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Answer the questions and proceed to deliver the product to the customer's room of choice.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Now you can deliver the product to the customer's room of choice.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.500
You'll review the price with the customer and get their approval.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:40.000
If the customer doesn't approve the price, refer to your company for instructions.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:46.800
Give the customer your device or follow the updated guidelines that were issued for COVID-19 to

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:48.000
obtain their signature.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.846
Customer clicks review price.

00:01:49.846 --> 00:01:54.000
If customer agrees with the price, they click yes.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.824
Customer will need to sign and click done.

00:01:56.824 --> 00:02:00.000
After they click done, a thank you page appears.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.667
Customer hands you the phone.

00:02:01.667 --> 00:02:06.000
Once you're at your vehicle, click complete job to take a selfie.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:10.552
For safety purposes, you must take the selfie photo at your vehicle.

00:02:10.552 --> 00:02:15.862
A selfie confirms that the person who was assigned the job completed the job.

00:02:15.862 --> 00:02:17.000
Click take photo.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Take your selfie and submit it.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.000
The task is complete.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.000
This completes the delivery.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.125
On the home page, you will see a successful completion notification.

00:02:28.125 --> 00:02:30.375
The task will no longer display.

00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:33.000
Your next delivery displays in the queue.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.000
You'll repeat the same steps for each new delivery.
